{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "的野美青です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15thシングル 選抜メンバーとして活動させていただくことになりました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも温かく支え続けてくださる皆さん、本当にありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今シングルも、自分の持てるすべてのエネルギーをパフォーマンスへと注ぎ込めるように\n最高に楽しんでいきたいなと思っています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15thシングルも、どうか一番近くで見守っていてください(◜ᴗ◝ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よろしくお願いします！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼\n￼\n￼"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15thシングル「Lonesome rabbit」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Music Video 公開しました！\n先行配信もスタートしています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobDZGdUx.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うさぎは寂しいと死んでしまう、という有名な説がありますよね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でも櫻坂のうさぎはそんなヤワじゃないですよ🐰"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最高にスリリングでかっこいい世界を、皆さんにお届けしていきます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobNAXSss.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob5Nmpm4.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんの前でパフォーマンスさせていただくのが待ち遠しいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん聴いていただけると嬉しいです！！"}], "source": "official"}